&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;葬祭事業子会社の支配及び管理（持株会社）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 234px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
